<title>UK: Banco BCN prices $100 mln eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BCN prices $100 mln eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BCN</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     8.125     MATURITY    08.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.75     PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  75 BP     REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD     *+230 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 MGT/UND    37.5 BP   SELL CONC   37.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A CALL AND PUT OPTION AT 99.70 ON 08.AUG.00</p>
<p>	     *SPREAD TO THE THREE YEAR PUT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
